{"2930130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ROVA", "steam_appid": 2930130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROVA is a cozy space-rover photography game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a new space colony conduct research on large spherical planets, by documenting <br>elements of alien worlds through photography. ROVA is a game about discovery and <br>exploration. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACE-ROVA PHOTOGRAPHY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph EVERYTHING, with your very own ROVA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULLY EXPLORABLE PLANET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an entire alien planet packed with research opportunities, just waiting to be discovered  <br>through your photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEARCH DATABASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each photo you take expands the Research Database. Can you find everything there is <br>to discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEARCH CREW CUSTOMISATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space research in style. Customise the research crew with a range of clothing options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Space-ROVA photography </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Research Database: grows with every photo you take!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A fully explorable planet with unique biomes and ecosystems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your photos to your PC. Perfect for desktop backgrounds or <br>sharing with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rover and Research Crew customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 'Observation/study mode' - listen to lofi songs whilst observing the crew perform  <br>their daily routines </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROVA is a cozy space-rover photography game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a new space colony conduct research on large spherical planets, by documenting <br>elements of alien worlds through photography. ROVA is a game about discovery and <br>exploration. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23da0150c33c1d93827318d58edc5e91.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACE-ROVA PHOTOGRAPHY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph EVERYTHING, with your very own ROVA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/23d02cf3ba699cfb04fb065997812081.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULLY EXPLORABLE PLANET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an entire alien planet packed with research opportunities, just waiting to be discovered  <br>through your photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/a09243ed03c720224eff8c5b1ee0b5b0.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEARCH DATABASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each photo you take expands the Research Database. Can you find everything there is <br>to discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/1855f1302aa8bcdd7714a8448f58a090.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEARCH CREW CUSTOMISATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space research in style. Customise the research crew with a range of clothing options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.poster.avif?t=1778318595\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.webm?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/b75eee0c2bfba5e69be3308242ae7e44.mp4?t=1778318595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Space-ROVA photography </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Research Database: grows with every photo you take!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A fully explorable planet with unique biomes and ecosystems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your photos to your PC. Perfect for desktop backgrounds or <br>sharing with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rover and Research Crew customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 'Observation/study mode' - listen to lofi songs whilst observing the crew perform  <br>their daily routines </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "ROVA is a cozy space-rover photography game. Help a new space colony conduct research on large spherical planets, by documenting elements of alien worlds through photography. ROVA is a game about discovery and exploration.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/8179cb1a6c3630b41fffd2523dce68f83a8a7f72/header.jpg?t=1778318595", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/74c47fbde64d16567ba5d6356a3a69880042665a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778318595", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/74c47fbde64d16567ba5d6356a3a69880042665a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778318595", "website": "https://freerangedevs.uk/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© FreeRangeDevs, 2024. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["FreeRangeDevs"], "publishers": ["FreeRangeDevs"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 799, "final": 799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$7.99"}, "packages": [1043705], "package_groups": [{"name": "def